<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><title>Subscribe to Alerts · bitcoin++</title>{{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/shop.css?v=20260718-11"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/service-checkout.css?v=4"></head>
<body class="shop-page">{{ block "mainnav" . }}{{ end }}
<main class="service-checkout service-checkout--account">
<nav class="service-account-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li><li><a href="/dashboard/subscriptions">Subscriptions</a></li><li><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Alerts billing</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Annual card plan</span></li></ol></nav>
<section>
<header class="service-checkout__head"><span class="service-kicker">BITCOIN++ ALERTS</span><h1>Review your annual plan</h1><p>Your first three repositories are free. Add {{ .Slots }} more for {{ .Total }} per year.</p></header>
<p>USD, including applicable tax. Renews annually until canceled. Your selections activate after payment is verified.</p>
{{ if .Enabled }}<form method="post" action="/services/alerts/subscribe">
<input type="hidden" name="account" value="{{ .Account }}"><input type="hidden" name="slots" value="{{ .Slots }}"><input type="hidden" name="key" value="{{ .Key }}"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}">
{{ with .Policy }}
<details><summary>Read the Terms of Service · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .TermsText }}</div></details>
<details><summary>Read the Privacy Policy · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .PrivacyText }}</div></details>
<input type="hidden" name="legal_version" value="{{ .Version }}">
<label><input type="checkbox" name="accept_terms" value="yes" required> I agree to these Terms of Service and acknowledge the Privacy Policy.</label>
{{ end }}
<button type="submit" class="service-primary">Continue with card · {{ .Total }}/year</button></form>
{{ else }}<p role="status">Card checkout is not configured here yet.</p>{{ end }}
<p><a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/privacy">Privacy</a></p>
<p><a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/alerts">Return to My alerts</a></p>
</section><aside class="service-summary" aria-label="Order summary">
<img src="/static/img/alerts-checkout.svg" alt="" width="640" height="360">
<div class="service-summary__body">
<h2><span class="service-wordmark">bitcoin++</span> Alerts</h2>
<p class="service-note">Software release notifications, delivered by email and Telegram.</p>
<dl>
<div><dt>Free projects</dt><dd>3 included</dd></div>
<div><dt>Additional projects</dt><dd>{{ .Slots }}</dd></div>
<div><dt>Billing period</dt><dd>Yearly</dd></div>
<div class="service-total"><dt>Annual total</dt><dd>{{ .Total }}</dd></div>
</dl><p class="service-note">USD · applicable tax included.</p>
</div></aside></main></body></html>
